Finally, we perform a last reshaping of the data set to get each gene in a
dedicated column via `tidyr::pivot_wider()`:


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
chk <- tidyr::pivot_wider(df, names_from = gene, values_from = value)
chk
